# Layout since 2026-11-03: src/<approach>/methods/<method>/ ; network code is model.py (not in a models/ folder).
# Legacy weight folders (src/<approach>/methods/<method>/models/) stay ignored by the `models/` rule above.
# Run folders methods/<method>/[enhanced/]runs/<split>__<tag>/ are COMMITTED (metrics.json, grid.png, log.csv,
# args.json); checkpoints (best.pt, last.pt) are ignored by the *.pt rule. Smoke-test runs are not results:
**/runs/smoke__*/
